    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "这几步挺像样，准备过吧。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_entry_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_opening_book_entry_03",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "熟门熟路的，先稳住。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_entry_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_opening_book_entry_04",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_entry",
    "text": "开头拾掇得利落，往下看。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_entry_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_01",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "书翻完了，脑子该接班啦。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_01.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_02",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "接下来没有小抄，自己拿主意。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_02.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_03",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "熟路走到头，别跟着惯性跑。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_03.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_04",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "opening_book_exit",
    "text": "理论歇一歇，轮到你动真格。",
    "file": "meiyi_opening_book_exit_04.m4a",
    "actors": [
      "player"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "meiyi_player_accurate_01",
    "role": "meiyi",
    "coachIndex": 7,
    "category": "player_accurate",
    "text": "这一手细致，我挑不出刺。",
